 your attack roll when attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," the target. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," attempt succeeds, you may choose to let the item drop to the ground in the target's fighting space or have the item fly into your hand (in which case you must have a free hand to catch it).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to damage or destroy the target weapon instead. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," attempt succeeds, the weapon takes damage equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check result. You must declare that you are using this option before making your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," attempt. If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Disarm","referenceId":"reference:ad868a04c89cdc16"}," feat, you gain the +5 bonus on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check to activate ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Disarm"]}," as though you were making an attack roll\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
